  "adaptations": [
    "All vendored files are unchanged upstream bytes. Only HTTP-served MiniWoB HTML adds a script immediately after core.js to seed its original random generator and change EPISODE_MAX_TIME from 10000 to 180000 milliseconds.",
    "MiniWoB START is a model action counted in the shared task budget. The first episode goal is independently latched by the driver before answer approval. Missing initial evidence is UNKNOWN.",
    "MiniWoB success requires original done/raw reward/episode count and exact native control state against the latched initial goal. Positive partial reward is failure.",
    "TodoMVC tasks derive from official Cypress assertions at spec.cy.js lines 561-587, 763-791 and 962-979. The model creates all initial todos through public controls within its task budget.",
    "TodoMVC React uses in-memory state. No persistence assertion is added. Local learn.json returns 404.",
    "These are local environment ports, not official benchmark scores. The seedrandom supplementary upstream license does not establish the exact embedded seedrandom version.",
    "MiniWoB document continuity uses Main-owned native page/document identity and a permanent observed-restart flag. Same-seed reloads cannot reuse the first episode goal as a successful new attempt.",
    "TodoMVC Active verification reads All through the normal filter control after task completion, requires exactly the three original items with only the second completed, then restores and verifies Active. This adds no model actions or model budget."
  ],
